                    {
                        "sense_id": "5249eb9a-dcb1-3c54-9b40-93d048ae1489",
                        "entry_id": "ca98151d-e442-353a-9089-ebf26ff4689e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An allotrope of carbon, consisting of planes of carbon atoms arranged in hexagonal arrays with the planes stacked loosely, that is used as a dry lubricant, in \\\"lead\\\" pencils, and as a moderator in some nuclear reactors."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1631f3c4-7bdb-4f44-817a-7fd11ba3816c",
                                "sense_id": "5249eb9a-dcb1-3c54-9b40-93d048ae1489",
                                "text": "Technical terms like ferrite, perlite, graphite, and hardenite were bandied to and fro, and when Paget glibly brought out such a rare exotic as ferro-molybdenum, Benson forgot that he was a master ship-builder, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a8eb8f8-ac1a-3bbb-a7e9-bfb56c220918",
                        "entry_id": "ca98151d-e442-353a-9089-ebf26ff4689e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Graphite-reinforced plastic, a composite plastic made with graphite fibers noted for lightweight strength and stiffness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5909807-b5cc-4472-8e76-5b7988ca8e26",
                                "sense_id": "8a8eb8f8-ac1a-3bbb-a7e9-bfb56c220918",
                                "text": "Modern tennis racquets are made of graphite, fibreglass and other man-made materials."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "457e3c65-56e6-3300-ab31-6c2227533a1b",
                        "entry_id": "ca98151d-e442-353a-9089-ebf26ff4689e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A grey colour, resembling graphite or the marks made with a graphite pencil."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
